{"pack": "star_wars", "title": "Darth Zannah", "url": "https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/Darth_Zannah", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"title-eraicons\" style=\"float:right;position:static;display:none\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Canon\" title=\"This article details a subject that is considered canon.\"><img alt=\"This article details a subject that is considered canon.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"112\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Premium-Eras-canon.png\" data-image-key=\"Premium-Eras-canon.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/b/be/Premium-Eras-canon.png/revision/latest?cb=20170617140440\" /></a></span></div><table id=\"canontab\" style=\"text-align:center;padding:0;margin:0 0 5px 0;border-left:0;border-right:0;border-top:0;border-bottom:0;border-spacing:0;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;vertical-align:top\"><tbody><tr><td id=\"canontab-canon&#95;ctcw\" style=\"padding:5px 0 5px 0;background-color:#002e54;line-height:0.95em;font-size:150%;font-weight:bold;border-bottom:3px solid #002e54;min-width:170px;vertical-align:top;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0\"> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Zannah\" title=\"This article covers the Canon version of this subject.\"><img alt=\"This article covers the Canon version of this subject.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"170\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Tab-canon-white.png\" data-image-key=\"Tab-canon-white.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/7/7d/Tab-canon-white.png/revision/latest?cb=20140430180745\" /></a></span></td><td id=\"canontab-separator1\" style=\"width:3px;border-bottom:3px solid #002e54\">&#160;</td><td id=\"canontab-legends&#95;ctlb\" style=\"padding:5px 0 5px 0;background-color:#d8e9fc;line-height:0.95em;font-size:150%;font-weight:bold;border-bottom:3px solid #002e54;min-width:170px;vertical-align:top;border-radius:5px 5px 0 0\"> <span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Zannah/Legends\" title=\"Click here for Wookieepedia&#39;s article on the Legends version of this subject.\"><img alt=\"Click here for Wookieepedia&#39;s article on the Legends version of this subject.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"170\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Tab-legends-black.png\" data-image-key=\"Tab-legends-black.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/2/28/Tab-legends-black.png/revision/latest?cb=20140430180745\" /></a></span></td><td id=\"canontab-separator2\" style=\"width:3000px\">&#160;</td></tr></tbody></table><p><span class=\"mobileTopIcons\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Canon\" title=\"Canon\"><img alt=\"OnACanonArticle\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"41\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"OnACanonArticle.png\" data-image-key=\"OnACanonArticle.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/4/47/OnACanonArticle.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20250314035517\" /></a></span><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Zannah/Legends\" title=\"Darth Zannah/Legends\"><img alt=\"GoToLegends\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"150\" height=\"41\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"GoToLegends.png\" data-image-key=\"GoToLegends.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/c/cd/GoToLegends.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/150?cb=20171212195307\" /></a></span></span>\n</p><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-character pi-theme-Sith pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Darth Zannah</h2>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\" data-item-name=\"mobile-eras\"><center></center></nav>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color pi-collapse pi-collapse-open\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Chronological &amp; political information</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"affiliation\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Affiliation(s)</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Sith\" title=\"Sith\">Sith</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Sacrifice&#95;1-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Sacrifice-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"masters\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Masters</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Bane\" title=\"Darth Bane\">Darth Bane</a><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Sacrifice&#95;1-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Sacrifice-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\"><small><span class=\"plainlinks\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://starwars.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Character\">[Source]</a></span></small><br /></nav>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><span>\"<i>I chose to pass my knowledge on to only one. I created a legacy so resilient that now, you come before me.</i>\"</span></dd>\n<dd>&#8213;An illusion of Darth Bane, to <a href=\"/wiki/Yoda\" title=\"Yoda\">Yoda</a><span class=\"noprint\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Sacrifice&#95;1-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Sacrifice-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></span></dd></dl></div>\n<p><b>Darth Zannah</b> was a <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Lord_of_the_Sith\" title=\"Dark Lord of the Sith\">Dark Lord of the Sith</a> and the <a href=\"/wiki/Sith_apprentice\" title=\"Sith apprentice\">Sith apprentice</a> of <a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Bane\" title=\"Darth Bane\">Darth Bane</a>. Zannah was trained to carry Bane's teachings and the <a href=\"/wiki/Rule_of_Two\" title=\"Rule of Two\">Rule of Two</a> forward after a <a href=\"/wiki/Jedi-Sith_War\" title=\"Jedi-Sith War\">war</a> between the <a href=\"/wiki/Sith\" title=\"Sith\">Sith</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Jedi_Order\" title=\"Jedi Order\">Jedi Orders</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Biography\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Biography</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Behind_the_scenes\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Behind the scenes</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Sources\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Sources</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Notes_and_references\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Notes and references</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Biography\">Biography</span></h2>\n<div class=\"quote\">\n<dl><dd><span>\"<i>Lord Bane's own apprentice struck him down to claim Bane's place. And so began a magnificently vicious cycle. Many Sith apprentices&#8212;myself included&#8212;have supplanted their masters in order to ascend.</i>\"</span></dd>\n<dd>&#8213;Darth Sidious<span class=\"noprint\"><sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Secrets&#95;of&#95;the&#95;Sith&#95;2-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Secrets_of_the_Sith-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup></span></dd></dl></div>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-right show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 250px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/a/a3/SithOrder-SOTJ.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260528044449\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Darth Bane, the Sith Master of Darth Zannah, reformed the Sith Order by creating the Rule of Two.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"207\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"SithOrder-SOTJ.jpg\" data-image-key=\"SithOrder-SOTJ.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/a/a3/SithOrder-SOTJ.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20260528044449\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/a/a3/SithOrder-SOTJ.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20260528044449\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Darth Bane, the Sith Master of Darth Zannah, reformed the Sith Order by creating the Rule of Two.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/a/a3/SithOrder-SOTJ.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20260528044449\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"207\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"SithOrder-SOTJ.jpg\" data-image-key=\"SithOrder-SOTJ.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/a/a3/SithOrder-SOTJ.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20260528044449\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:SithOrder-SOTJ.jpg\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Darth Bane, the Sith Master of Darth Zannah, reformed the Sith Order by creating the Rule of Two.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>Approximately <a href=\"/wiki/Millennium\" title=\"Millennium\">one thousand years</a> prior to the <a href=\"/wiki/Invasion_of_Naboo\" title=\"Invasion of Naboo\">Invasion of Naboo</a>, the <a href=\"/wiki/Sith_Lord\" title=\"Sith Lord\">Sith Lord</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Bane\" title=\"Darth Bane\">Darth Bane</a> enacted the <a href=\"/wiki/Rule_of_Two\" title=\"Rule of Two\">Rule of Two</a>. This teaching mandated that there would only be two <a href=\"/wiki/Sith\" title=\"Sith\">Sith</a> at any given <a href=\"/wiki/Time\" title=\"Time\">time</a>; a <a href=\"/wiki/Sith_Master\" title=\"Sith Master\">master</a> to embody power, and an <a href=\"/wiki/Sith_apprentice\" title=\"Sith apprentice\">apprentice</a> to crave it.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-BaneDB&#95;3-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-BaneDB-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> As part of the Rule of Two, Bane took on an apprentice,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Sacrifice&#95;1-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Sacrifice-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> <a href=\"/wiki/Darth\" title=\"Darth\">Darth</a> Zannah,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-HC&#95;2&#95;4-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HC_2-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> to whom he passed on his teachings.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Sacrifice&#95;1-4\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Sacrifice-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Zannah escaped the notice of the <a href=\"/wiki/Jedi_Order\" title=\"Jedi Order\">Jedi Order</a>. After Bane's defeat, his apprentice carried on the Rule of Two, which allowed the Sith to survive in secret while the <a href=\"/wiki/Jedi\" title=\"Jedi\">Jedi</a> falsely believed that the Sith had become extinct.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SWEBane&#95;5-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SWEBane-5\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>5<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Although the historical records were not accurate about the identity of Bane's apprentice or how Bane <a href=\"/wiki/Death\" title=\"Death\">died</a>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-SW:TDS&#95;6-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-SW:TDS-6\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>6<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> he supposedly died in a <a href=\"/wiki/Lightsaber_duel\" title=\"Lightsaber duel\">duel</a> with Zannah on the <a href=\"/wiki/Inner_Rim_Territories\" title=\"Inner Rim Territories\">Inner Rim</a> world of <a href=\"/wiki/Ambria\" title=\"Ambria\">Ambria</a>, a pattern which would be repeated by almost all Sith thereafter.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-HC&#95;2&#95;4-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HC_2-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 250px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/5/52/Sidious_hologram.png/revision/latest?cb=20200921210616\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Darth Sidious ascended to power by killing his master, Darth Plagueis, a millennium after Bane was killed by his apprentice.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"166\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Sidious hologram.png\" data-image-key=\"Sidious_hologram.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/5/52/Sidious_hologram.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20200921210616\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/5/52/Sidious_hologram.png/revision/latest?cb=20200921210616\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Darth Sidious ascended to power by killing his master, Darth Plagueis, a millennium after Bane was killed by his apprentice.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/5/52/Sidious_hologram.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20200921210616\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"166\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Sidious hologram.png\" data-image-key=\"Sidious_hologram.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/5/52/Sidious_hologram.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20200921210616\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Sidious_hologram.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Darth Sidious ascended to power by killing his master, Darth Plagueis, a millennium after Bane was killed by his apprentice.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Sidious\" title=\"Darth Sidious\">Darth Sidious</a>' <a href=\"/wiki/Book\" title=\"Book\">book</a>, <i><a href=\"/wiki/The_Secrets_of_the_Sith\" title=\"The Secrets of the Sith\">The Secrets of the Sith</a></i> recounted the history of the Sith Order, including its reformation under Darth Bane and his apprentice. Sidious praised<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Secrets&#95;of&#95;the&#95;Sith&#95;2-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Secrets_of_the_Sith-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Zannah's master<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-HC&#95;2&#95;4-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HC_2-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> as a great Sith Lord; he acknowledged Bane as the founder of a Sith line of succession that culminated in his rise to power as <a href=\"/wiki/Galactic_Emperor\" title=\"Galactic Emperor\">ruler</a> of the <a href=\"/wiki/Galactic_Empire\" title=\"Galactic Empire\">Galactic Empire</a>. Sidious also credited Bane and his apprentice for starting the Rule of Two, thereby ensuring the Sith Order's survival through a succession of Sith apprentices ascending to the power of the dark side by killing their masters, beginning with Bane's death by the hand of his own pupil. Though not all Sith apprentices were able to supplant their masters, Sidious successfully completed his apprenticeship by killing his master, <a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Plagueis\" title=\"Darth Plagueis\">Darth Plagueis</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Secrets&#95;of&#95;the&#95;Sith&#95;2-2\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Secrets_of_the_Sith-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Behind_the_scenes\">Behind the scenes</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-right show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 250px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/d/d8/BaneZannah-DoE.png/revision/latest?cb=20220818045538\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Darth Bane and Darth Zannah in the Star Wars Legends continuity.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"BaneZannah-DoE.png\" data-image-key=\"BaneZannah-DoE.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/d/d8/BaneZannah-DoE.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20220818045538\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/d/d8/BaneZannah-DoE.png/revision/latest?cb=20220818045538\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Darth Bane and Darth Zannah in the Star Wars Legends continuity.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/d/d8/BaneZannah-DoE.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20220818045538\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"180\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"BaneZannah-DoE.png\" data-image-key=\"BaneZannah-DoE.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/d/d8/BaneZannah-DoE.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/250?cb=20220818045538\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:BaneZannah-DoE.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Darth Bane and Darth Zannah in the <i>Star Wars</i> Legends continuity.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Canon\" title=\"Canon\">Canonically</a>, Darth Zannah was first mentioned, albeit indirectly, in the episode \"<a href=\"/wiki/Sacrifice_(episode)\" title=\"Sacrifice (episode)\">Sacrifice</a>,\" the thirteenth and final episode of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Clone_Wars:_The_Lost_Missions\" title=\"The Clone Wars: The Lost Missions\">sixth season</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_The_Clone_Wars\" title=\"Star Wars: The Clone Wars\">Star Wars: The Clone Wars</a></i>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Sacrifice&#95;1-5\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Sacrifice-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Zannah was first identified by name in the magazine <a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars_Helmet_Collection_2\" title=\"Star Wars Helmet Collection 2\"><i>Star Wars Helmet Collection</i> 2</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-HC&#95;2&#95;4-3\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-HC_2-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> In <a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars_Legends\" title=\"Star Wars Legends\"><i>Star Wars</i> Legends</a>, Darth Bane's apprentice was first mentioned in <a href=\"/wiki/Terry_Brooks\" title=\"Terry Brooks\">Terry Brooks</a>' <a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_Episode_I_The_Phantom_Menace_(novelization)\" title=\"Star Wars: Episode I The Phantom Menace (novelization)\">novelization</a> for <a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_Episode_I_The_Phantom_Menace\" title=\"Star Wars: Episode I The Phantom Menace\"><i>Star Wars</i>: Episode I <i>The Phantom Menace</i></a>. As the novelization was written before the identity of Zannah was established, it refers to Darth Bane's apprentice as \"him.\"<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-TPMNovelization&#95;7-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TPMNovelization-7\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>7<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> Brooks' novelization was based on backstory notes from <i><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars\" title=\"Star Wars\">Star Wars</a></i> creator <a href=\"/wiki/George_Lucas\" title=\"George Lucas\">George Lucas</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-Endnotes&#95;for&#95;the&#95;NEC&#95;8-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-Endnotes_for_the_NEC-8\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>8<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> The character of <a href=\"/wiki/Darth_Zannah/Legends\" title=\"Darth Zannah/Legends\">Zannah</a> first appeared in the <a href=\"/wiki/Jedi_vs._Sith_1\" title=\"Jedi vs. Sith 1\">first issue</a> of the comic series <i><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_Jedi_vs._Sith\" title=\"Star Wars: Jedi vs. Sith\">Star Wars: Jedi vs. Sith</a></i>,<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-jvs1&#95;9-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-jvs1-9\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>9<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup> which was published on <a href=\"/wiki/April_18\" title=\"April 18\">April 18</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/2001\" title=\"2001\">2001</a> by <a href=\"/wiki/Dark_Horse_Comics\" title=\"Dark Horse Comics\">Dark Horse Comics</a>.<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-DH&#95;10-0\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-DH-10\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>10<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"mhi\"><span class=\"mw-default-size mw-valign-text-top\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_The_Clone_Wars\" title=\"Star Wars: The Clone Wars\"><img alt=\"TCW mini logo\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"25\" height=\"16\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"TCW mini logo.jpg\" data-image-key=\"TCW_mini_logo.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/c/c8/TCW_mini_logo.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20081006205514\" /></a></span></span> <i><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars:_The_Clone_Wars\" title=\"Star Wars: The Clone Wars\">Star Wars: The Clone Wars</a></i> &#8212; \"<a href=\"/wiki/Sacrifice_(episode)\" title=\"Sacrifice (episode)\">Sacrifice</a>\" <small>(First mentioned)</small> <small>(Indirect mention only)</small></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sources\">Sources</span></h2>\n<ul><li><span class=\"mti\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Encyclopedia_(StarWars.com)\" title=\"StarWars.com Encyclopedia\"><img alt=\"StarWars.com Encyclopedia\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"81\" height=\"12\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Encyclopedia-Logo.jpg\" data-image-key=\"Encyclopedia-Logo.jpg\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/starwars/images/8/83/Encyclopedia-Logo.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20110914173933\" /></a></span>&#160;<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20140611233856/http://starwars.com/explore/encyclopedia/groups/sith\">Sith</a> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Encyclopedia_(StarWars.com)\" title=\"Encyclopedia (StarWars.com)\">Encyclopedia</a> <small> (<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://starwars.com/explore/encyclopedia/groups/sith\">original site</a> is defunct)</small></span> <small>(Indirect mention only)</small></li>\n<li><span class=\"pnh\"><a href=\"/wiki/Star_Wars_Helmet_Collection_2\" title=\"Star Wars Helmet Collection 2\"><i>Star Wars Helmet Collection</i>: Boba Fett</a></span> <small class=\"cgct\">Databank A-Z: Alzoc III&#8211;Antilles</small> <small>(First identified as Darth Zannah)</small></li>\n<li><span class=\"pnh\"><span class=\"mhi\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Topps\" title=\"Topps\"><img alt=\"ToppsLogo-Template\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"32\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" 